msgid "  ✨ AI Suggested Fee"
msgstr "  ✨ Von der KI vorgeschlagene Gebühr"

#: public/class-woocommerce-conditional-product-fees-for-checkout-public.php:2570
#: public/class-woocommerce-conditional-product-fees-for-checkout-public.php:7809
msgid " Fees"
msgstr " Gebühren"

#: includes/class-wcpfc-fee-suggestion-engine.php:529
msgid ""
"%1$d%% of orders exceed %2$s%3$s. High-value baskets often justify white-"
"glove packing, insurance, or priority fulfillment that you can monetize as "
"an optional premium service."
msgstr ""
"%1$d%% der Bestellungen übersteigen %2$s%3$s. Hochwertige Warenkörbe "
"rechtfertigen oft Premium-Verpackung, Versicherung oder priorisierte "
"Erfüllung, die Sie als optionalen Premium-Service monetarisieren "
"können."

#. translators: 1: percent, 2: currency symbol, 3: threshold amount
#: includes/class-wcpfc-fee-suggestion-engine.php:271
msgid ""
"%1$d%% of orders in the last 90 days had a cart subtotal below %2$s%3$s. Low-"
"value purchases often reduce profitability because packaging, payment "
"processing, and fulfillment costs stay similar regardless of order size."
msgstr ""
"%1$d%% der Bestellungen in den letzten 90 Tagen hatten eine "
"Warenkorb-Zwischensumme unter %2$s%3$s. Käufe mit geringem Wert "
"mindern oft die Rentabilität, weil Verpackungs-, Zahlungsabwicklungs- "
"und Erfüllungkosten unabhängig von der Bestellgröße ähnlich bleiben."

#: includes/class-wcpfc-fee-suggestion-engine.php:420
msgid "%1$s %2$s checkouts/month × %3$s%4$s ≈ %5$s/month"
msgstr "%1$s %2$s Checkouts/Monat × %3$s%4$s ≈ %5$s/Monat"

#. translators: 1: fee title, 2 fee id
#: admin/class-woocommerce-conditional-product-fees-for-checkout-admin.php:4960
#: admin/class-woocommerce-conditional-product-fees-for-checkout-admin.php:5017
msgid "%1$s (#%2$s)"
msgstr "%1$s (#%2$s)"

#. translators: %1$s: date with format, %2$s: Time with format
#: admin/list-tables/class-wc-conditional-product-fees-table.php:514
msgid "%1$s at %2$s"
msgstr "%1$s bei %2$s"

#: includes/class-wcpfc-fee-suggestion-engine.php:498
msgid "%1$s category orders/month × %2$s%% avg fee on ~%3$s AOV ≈ %4$s/month"
msgstr ""
"%1$s Kategoriebestellungen/Monat × %2$s%% durchschnittliche Gebühr auf "
"~%3$s AOV ≈ %4$s/Monat"

#. translators: 1: condition label, 2: value
#: includes/class-wcpfc-fee-suggestion-engine.php:941
msgid "%1$s is %2$s"
msgstr "%1$s ist %2$s"

#. translators: 1: condition label, 2: value
#: includes/class-wcpfc-fee-suggestion-engine.php:933
msgid "%1$s is not %2$s"
msgstr "%1$s ist nicht %2$s"

#. translators: 1: payment title, 2: percent, 3: count
#: includes/class-wcpfc-fee-suggestion-engine.php:413
msgid ""
"%1$s is used on %2$d%% of completed orders (%3$s in 90 days). Some gateways "
"charge higher interchange, FX, or manual reconciliation effort that your "
"product margin may not absorb."
msgstr ""
"%1$s wird bei %2$d%% der abgeschlossenen Bestellungen verwendet (%3$s "
"in 90 Tagen). Einige Gateways verursachen höhere Interchange-, FX- "
"oder manuelle Abstimmungsaufwände, die Ihre Produktmarge "
"möglicherweise nicht auffängt."

#: includes/class-wcpfc-fee-suggestion-engine.php:324
msgid "%1$s orders/month from %2$s (%3$d%%) × %4$s%5$s ≈ %6$s/month"
msgstr "%1$s Bestellungen/Monat aus %2$s (%3$d%%) × %4$s%5$s ≈ %6$s/Monat"

#: includes/class-wcpfc-fee-suggestion-engine.php:375
msgid "%1$s orders/month with this product (%2$d%%) × %3$s%4$s ≈ %5$s/month"
msgstr "%1$s Bestellungen/Monat mit diesem Produkt (%2$d%%) × %3$s%4$s ≈ %5$s/Monat"

#: includes/class-wcpfc-fee-suggestion-engine.php:536
msgid "%1$s premium orders/month × %2$s%% on ~%3$s%4$s baskets ≈ %5$s/month"
msgstr "%1$s Premium-Bestellungen/Monat × %2$s%% auf ~%3$s%4$s Warenkörbe ≈ %5$s/Monat"

#. translators: 1: country, 2: percent, 3: order count
#: includes/class-wcpfc-fee-suggestion-engine.php:317
msgid ""
"%1$s represents %2$d%% of your orders (%3$s orders in 90 days). Cross-border "
"or regional orders often carry higher shipping, customs documentation, or "
"carrier surcharges that standard product pricing does not cover."
msgstr ""
"%1$s macht %2$d%% Ihrer Bestellungen aus (%3$s Bestellungen in 90 "
"Tagen). Grenzüberschreitende oder regionale Bestellungen verursachen "
"oft höhere Versandkosten, Zollunterlagen oder Spediteurzuschläge, die "
"die Standardproduktpreise nicht abdecken."

